## 2. Model

### 2.1. Model Architecture

The proposed model architecture is shown in Figure \ref{fig:arch}. It consists of an input layer, three convolutional layers, two fully connected layers, and an output layer. The first convolutional layer has a kernel size of $3 \times 3$ and a stride of 1, while the second convolutional layer has a kernel size of $3 \times 3$ and a stride of 2. The fully connected layers have sizes of 512 and 10, respectively.

